          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Have you tried deleting CMakeCache.txt from your build dir, or the entire build dir, and then running the CMake generation step again?\n\nUnfortunately if anything changes in the environment, such as a 3rd party library, then the build won't pick that up as CMake has cached it.  This then requires the \"remediation\" step above.",
