      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 598391680,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Can you try this instead?\n\n```\ndiff --git a/cmake/modules/FindGLIB2.cmake b/cmake/modules/FindGLIB2.cmake\nindex ad3cb4bee8..b8151d6491 100644\n--- a/cmake/modules/FindGLIB2.cmake\n+++ b/cmake/modules/FindGLIB2.cmake\n@@ -72,9 +72,9 @@ find_path( GLIB2_INTERNAL_INCLUDE_DIR\n        NAMES\n                glibconfig.h\n        HINTS\n+               \"${glib2LibDir}\"\n                \"${GLIB2_INCLUDEDIR}\"\n                \"${GLIB2_HINTS}/lib\"\n-               \"${glib2LibDir}\"\n                ${CMAKE_SYSTEM_LIBRARY_PATH}\n        PATH_SUFFIXES\n                glib-2.0/include\n```\n\n`glib2LibDir` should contain the parent path of libglib-2.0, and we should arguably search there first.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789948913",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
